{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17107510","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107510","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1710750501:":{"text":"皆さん、お集まりいただきありがとうございます。","source_cn":"诸位，晚上好","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F91EBF1EDE88D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1710753001:":{"text":"宴の席で眠ってしまわれるとは……","source_cn":"宴席之上竟如此沉睡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x794691501F11107D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1710753002:":{"text":"実に無作法にございますね。","source_cn":"实在有失体统","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x803B63932C2BCE0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1710753003:":{"text":"ならばこの私が……","source_cn":"就让我为诸位","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BC2D9E8BF3FAC26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1710753004:":{"text":"より良い場所へご案内いたしましょう。","source_cn":"安排一个更适合的场所","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89AA70FCFA0101C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710751001:0":{"text":"今宵の宴は、日中の猟苑での一件を受けてのものです。突然の襲撃に、さぞ驚かれたことでしょう。","source_cn":"诸位，今夜宴请是为了白日猎场之事。那突如其来的袭击，想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7D8E71855BD55E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710751002:0":{"text":"この場をお借りして、心よりお詫び申し上げます。","source_cn":"我在此，致以最深的歉意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1477741074886F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710751003:0":{"text":"しかし、その危機のさなか――グウィネス隊長は臆することなく魔物を討ち取り、皆さまの安全と王室の威信を守り抜きました。","source_cn":"但危难之际，格温妮丝队长临危不惧，斩杀巨蛛，护卫了诸位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFD07F2114097D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710751004:0":{"text":"この功を称え、私は彼女をテフラスキアの前線へ赴かせ、バンティスを迎え撃つ先鋒隊長として正式に任命します！","source_cn":"我已正式任命她前往灰影郡担任抵御班题斯的先锋官，相信她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A476D699EF4C99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710751005:0":{"text":"そして本日の襲撃については、必ずや徹底的に調べ上げ、真相を明らかにするとお約束いたします。","source_cn":"至于今日的袭击……我向诸位保证，我必将彻查此事，让真相...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x112F33924C18CFC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710751006:0":{"text":"宴会場に盛大な拍手が湧き起こった。続いて王子の声がもう一度響き渡る。今度は声を潜め、重々しい口ぶりになった。","source_cn":"宴会厅传来一阵热烈的掌声，随后王子的声音再次响起，这一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA224E1508079F972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710751007:0":{"text":"古聖堂の消失で、王都は不安に包まれ、様々な噂が後を絶ちません。","source_cn":"我知道，近来圣古堂无故消失，让王都人心惶惶，流言四起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98FE8CBE4F59DFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710751008:0":{"text":"ですがご安心ください。私の名にかけて、必ずや事態を早々に収めてみせます！","source_cn":"但请诸位放心！我在此承诺——此事，必将尽快有所了结！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0609A4A5352B75C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710751009:0":{"text":"今夜は憂いをすべて忘れ、美酒と料理を心ゆくまでご堪能ください。","source_cn":"今夜，且放下所有的忧虑！请尽情享用美酒与佳肴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F36C7613EE11481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710751010:0":{"text":"我らがブライトに、乾杯！","source_cn":"诸位，为了耀光，干杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC358ADE70EEEA31C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710751011:0":{"text":"その言葉にホールは沸き立ち、熱烈な拍手喝采と乾杯の声が絶え間なく響き渡った。","source_cn":"这番话引爆了全场，热烈的鼓掌声与干杯声此起彼伏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD1043AADB236BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710751012:0":{"text":"さすがは王子殿下！殿下がいれば、もう何も心配はありませんな！","source_cn":"王子殿下英明！有您在，我们就彻底放心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AC4524ACEB5D247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710751013:0":{"text":"うむ、エイドリアンになら、ブライトの未来も安心して任せられるな！","source_cn":"不错！奥利安才是耀光真正的未来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9C5F0AA82E62F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710751014:0":{"text":"もしやこれは……ベルベット・トラップの名物料理！？いやぁ、王子殿下は実に気前がいい！","source_cn":"这……这难道是丝绒陷阱的招牌菜？王子殿下真是太慷慨了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85811E06BDEDFD52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710751015:0":{"text":"あら、これは王室御用達の熟成酒ではなくて？ん～、なんていい香りかしら！","source_cn":"哦，佐餐的是王室窖藏的美酒吗？嗯……真是醇香！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9299A6A8E2FD5094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710751016:0":{"text":"うむ……だが、少し度数が高いな……頭が、フラフラしてきた……","source_cn":"……就是……度数有点高……头……有点晕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FC0ACDD031AD557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710751017:0":{"text":"カスマン殿も？……昼間の疲れがたたったのかしら……","source_cn":"你也是？唔……一定是今天太累了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2A7BB3B1C0E90B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710751018:0":{"text":"これは実に……美味、い――","source_cn":"这食物……美——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8BACB529553B893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710751019:0":{"text":"ガシャンッ――宴会ホールのざわめきが突如止んだ。","source_cn":"哐当——宴会厅的喧闹声戛然而止。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CEB4EC4D1B212A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710751020:0":{"text":"続いて、重たいものがテーブルや絨毯の上へ倒れ込む、鈍い音があちこちで響き――","source_cn":"紧接着，是此起彼伏的、重物倒在桌案和地毯上的闷响。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C891701A4AC711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:29:1710750501:":{"text":"皆さん、お集まりいただきありがとうございます。","source_cn":"诸位，晚上好","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F91EBF1EDE88D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document